v1.3.8
The first start after an in-menu update now provisions online source-IP
collection: the Bot enables statsUserOnline for level 0 and every client level,
validates the core configuration, and restarts Xray once with rollback on
failure. This closes the upgrade gap where self-update restarted only the Bot
service and left the online API empty. The online card now names any level that
has clients but keeps online statistics off, the footer is shorter, and the XFF
spoofing caveat is shown only when an address is actually displayed.
